          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 115251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte, dobbiamo convertire una serie di valori di un array in un singolo valore. Ad esempio, quando vogliamo calcolare una somma.</p><p>Un modo classico per farlo consiste nell'usare un ciclo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" total += element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte, dobbiamo convertire una serie di valori di un array in un singolo valore. Ad esempio, quando vogliamo calcolare una somma.</p><p>Un modo classico per farlo consiste nell'usare un ciclo. Completa l'aggiornamento del totale progressivo in modo che il codice visualizzi <code>207</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" total += element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"miles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>element</code>, seguito da <code>total</code> e infine <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Calling .reduce on an Array",
            "id": 115252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuttavia, JavaScript offre un metodo più semplice già esistente. <code>.reduce()</code> può combinare i valori di un Array in un unico valore usando una funzione inline.</p><p><code>.reduce()</code> usa la sintassi: <code>ArrayName.reduce()</code>. Vediamo come potremmo chiamarlo sull'array <code>miles</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"        \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>miles</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>reduce</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuttavia, JavaScript offre un metodo più semplice già esistente. <code>.reduce()</code> può combinare i valori di un Array in un unico valore usando una funzione inline.</p><p><code>.reduce()</code> usa la sintassi: <code>ArrayName.reduce()</code>. Crea questa chiamata al metodo su <code>miles</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"filter\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>miles</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>reduce</code>, <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Functions",
            "id": 115253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori, dobbiamo prima passare una funzione come parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori, dobbiamo prima passare una funzione come parametro.</p><p>Completa la callback vuota ricevuta da <code>reduce()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 115255,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La nostra funzione ha bisogno di due parametri: il primo per accedere al risultato della <strong>riduzione</strong> precedente e il secondo per accedere al valore corrente.</p><p>Aggiungi due parametri: <code>prev</code> e <code>curr</code>, in quest'ordine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>prev,</code>, seguito da <code>curr</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 115254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>reduce()</code> itera su un array e, a ogni valore, esegue un'operazione con i due parametri finché arriva a un singolo valore.</p><p>Ad esempio, per sommare i valori, la funzione inline restituisce la somma della riduzione <code>prev</code> e del valore <code>curr</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>reduce()</code> itera su un array e, a ogni valore, esegue un'operazione con i due parametri finché arriva a un singolo valore.</p><p>Ad esempio, per sommare i valori, la funzione inline restituisce la somma della riduzione <code>prev</code> e del valore <code>curr</code>.</p><p>Assegna al primo parametro il nome <code>prev</code> e al secondo <code>curr</code>.</p><p>Completa l'istruzione return affinché il codice stampi <code>207</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"total\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>prev</code>, seguito da <code>curr</code>, <code>return</code> e infine <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow functions",
            "id": 115258,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per semplificare la sintassi, possiamo usare una funzione freccia JavaScript al posto della funzione inline.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(prevVal, currVal)</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>prevVal + currVal</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per semplificare la sintassi, possiamo usare una funzione freccia JavaScript al posto della funzione inline.</p><p>Assegna ai parametri i nomi <code>prevVal</code> e <code>currVal</code>, in quest'ordine.</p><p>Metti <code>prevVal</code> a sinistra e <code>currVal</code> a destra. Scegli l'operatore affinché il totale sia <code>207</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>prevVal</code>, seguito da <code>currVal</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prevVal</code>, <code>+</code> e infine <code>currVal</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters II",
            "id": 115256,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se includiamo un terzo parametro nella funzione, possiamo anche accedere all'indice di ogni iterazione.</p><p>In questo esempio, usiamo <code>.reduce()</code> per sommare i valori di <code>prices</code>, ma incorporiamo anche <code>index</code> per applicare un fattore di sconto proveniente da un secondo array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discountFactor = [\" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + (currVal * discountFactor[index]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"161\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"214\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81.625\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>index</code>, seguito da <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se includiamo un terzo parametro nella funzione, possiamo anche accedere all'indice di ogni iterazione.</p><p>In questo esempio, usiamo <code>.reduce()</code> per sommare i valori di <code>prices</code>, ma incorporiamo anche <code>index</code>.</p><p>Applica un fattore di sconto da un secondo array. Completa la ricerca basata sull'indice in modo che il codice visualizzi <code>81.625</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discountFactor = [\" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + (currVal * discountFactor[index]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"161\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prices\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prevVal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"currVal\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81.625\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>discountFactor</code>, seguito da <code>index</code> e infine <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Intro",
            "id": 115259,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale funzione JavaScript possiamo usare per convertire una serie di valori di un array in un unico valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.reduce()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.filter()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.reduce()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale funzione JavaScript possiamo usare per convertire una serie di valori di un array in un unico valore?</p><p>Ti serve un unico totale ottenuto da tutti i numeri di un array. Scegli il metodo progettato per questo risultato.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.reduce()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.reduce()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115261,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa dobbiamo passare come parametro per dire alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una variabile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima che <code>.reduce()</code> possa sommare, confrontare o combinare i valori in altro modo, cosa devi fornire per descrivere l'operazione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una variabile</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un secondo array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Una funzione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 115262,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa dà accesso il primo parametro della funzione inline a <code>reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In una callback di <code>reduce()</code>, quale valore deve trovarsi nel primo parametro quando ti serve il risultato progressivo delle iterazioni precedenti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'indice dell'iterazione corrente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 115275,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa dà accesso il secondo parametro della funzione inline a <code>reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una callback aggiunge ogni elemento dell'array a un totale progressivo. Cosa deve rappresentare il secondo parametro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'indice dell'iterazione corrente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters II",
            "id": 115263,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa possiamo accedere aggiungendo un terzo parametro facoltativo alla funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'array chiamato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere L'indice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una riduzione richiede un valore nella stessa posizione di un altro array. Quale parametro facoltativo della callback fornisce questa posizione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'array chiamato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La riduzione precedente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere L'indice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling .reduce on an Array",
            "id": 115268,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione <code>.reduce()</code> sull'array <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"84.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>prices</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>reduce</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una funzione inline all'interno della funzione <code>.reduce()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" values = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" factorial = values.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 115270,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi i parametri appropriati per consentire alla funzione inline di accedere al valore della riduzione precedente e al valore corrente dell'array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" values = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" factorial = values.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev * curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(factorial);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>prev</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 115272,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vogliamo che la funzione <code>.reduce()</code> concateni tutte le <code>words</code> in una frase.</p><p>Scrivi la parola chiave corretta nella funzione inline in modo che restituisca il valore di riduzione precedente concatenato con la parola corrente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" words = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;house&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;is&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sentence = words.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sentence);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"105\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The house is red\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
